# Portfolio Testing Standards

## Testing Strategy Overview

Ray's portfolio uses Vitest for unit testing and Playwright for E2E testing, with special focus on accessibility compliance, modal interactions, and chart performance.

## Unit Testing with Vitest

### Test File Organization
```
src/
├── components/
│   ├── Header.tsx
│   ├── Header.test.tsx
│   ├── DemoCard.tsx
│   └── DemoCard.test.tsx
├── lib/
│   ├── motion.ts
│   └── motion.test.ts
└── __tests__/
    ├── setup.ts
    └── mocks/
        └── dashboardData.ts
```

### Component Testing Patterns
```typescript
// src/components/DemoCard.test.tsx
import { render, screen, fireEvent } from '@testing-library/react';
import { DemoCard } from './DemoCard';
import { DEMO_CARDS } from '@/lib/dashboards';

describe('DemoCard Component', () => {
  const mockOnOpen = vi.fn();
  const demoCard = DEMO_CARDS[0]; // SaaS Platform

  beforeEach(() => {
    mockOnOpen.mockClear();
  });

  it('renders demo card with correct content', () => {
    render(<DemoCard demo={demoCard} onOpen={mockOnOpen} />);
    
    expect(screen.getByText('SaaS Platform')).toBeInTheDocument();
    expect(screen.getByText('Multi-tenant KPIs & usage analytics')).toBeInTheDocument();
  });

  it('handles click to open dashboard', () => {
    render(<DemoCard demo={demoCard} onOpen={mockOnOpen} />);
    
    fireEvent.click(screen.getByRole('button'));
    expect(mockOnOpen).toHaveBeenCalledWith('saas');
  });

  it('supports keyboard navigation', () => {
    render(<DemoCard demo={demoCard} onOpen={mockOnOpen} />);
    
    const card = screen.getByRole('button');
    
    // Test Enter key
    fireEvent.keyDown(card, { key: 'Enter' });
    expect(mockOnOpen).toHaveBeenCalledWith('saas');
    
    // Test Space key
    mockOnOpen.mockClear();
    fireEvent.keyDown(card, { key: ' ' });
    expect(mockOnOpen).toHaveBeenCalledWith('saas');
  });

  it('has proper ARIA attributes', () => {
    render(<DemoCard demo={demoCard} onOpen={mockOnOpen} />);
    
    const card = screen.getByRole('button');
    expect(card).toHaveAttribute('aria-label', 'Open SaaS Platform dashboard');
    expect(card).toHaveAttribute('tabIndex', '0');
  });
});
```

