## Acceptance Testing Checklist

### Core Functionality
- [ ] All 6 demo cards render correctly
- [ ] Modal opens with shared-element transition
- [ ] Charts render within 50ms performance budget
- [ ] Filter updates complete within 80ms
- [ ] Skills section accordions animate properly
- [ ] Focus management works correctly

### Accessibility Compliance
- [ ] All interactive elements are keyboard accessible
- [ ] Screen readers can navigate all content
- [ ] Color contrast meets WCAG AA standards
- [ ] Focus indicators are visible
- [ ] ARIA labels and roles are properly implemented
- [ ] No accessibility violations in automated testing

### Performance Targets
- [ ] Lighthouse Performance ≥ 90
- [ ] Lighthouse Accessibility ≥ 95
- [ ] Lighthouse Best Practices ≥ 95
- [ ] Lighthouse SEO ≥ 90
- [ ] Main bundle ≤ 180KB gzipped
- [ ] CLS ≤ 0.03 on all interactions

